a Faso), Dahomey (now Benin), and Niger. The federation existed from 1895 until 1958. Its capital was Saint-Louis in Senegal until 1902, and then Dakar until the federation's collapse in 1960.\nWith an area of 4,689,000 km2, French West Africa was eight times the size of Metropolitan France."}],"facts":[{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"capital","value_qid":"Q3718","value_label":"Dakar","from_t":1902,"to_t":2018,"title":null,"property":"P36","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Dakar"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"capital","value_qid":"Q273779","value_label":"Saint-Louis","from_t":1895,"to_t":1902,"title":null,"property":"P36","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Saint-Louis"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"official_language","value_qid":"Q150","value_label":"French","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P37","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"French"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"government","value_qid":"Q43702","value_label":"federation","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P122","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"federation"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"government","value_qid":"Q133156","value_label":"colony","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P122","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"colony"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"predecessor","value_qid":"Q536476","value_label":"Empire Peul","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P1365","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Empire Peul"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"predecessor","value_qid":"Q568712","value_label":"Samorian state","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P1365","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Samorian state"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"successor","value_qid":"Q962","value_label":"Benin","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P1366","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Benin"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"successor","value_qid":"Q965","value_label":"Burkina Faso","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P1366","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Burkina Faso"},{"qid":"Q210682","kind":"successor","value